  (sid, mat_id, 'mcq', 'A tangent \(PQ\) at a point \(P\) of a circle of radius \(5\text{ cm}\) meets a line through the centre \(O\) at a point \(Q\) so that \(OQ = 12\text{ cm}\). The length of \(PQ\) is', '[{"key": "A", "value": "\\(12\\text{ cm}\\)", "correct": false}, {"key": "B", "value": "\\(13\\text{ cm}\\)", "correct": false}, {"key": "C", "value": "\\(8.5\\text{ cm}\\)", "correct": false}, {"key": "D", "value": "\\(\\sqrt{119}\\text{ cm}\\)", "correct": true}]', 'D', 1, 'medium', '["Circles"]', '["pythagoras_circle"]', true),
